+# Read when an area starts. A quest with no block here gives no XP.
+# For scale (XP for one more level): skills starting at 1 need 80 for level 2
+# and 88 more for level 3; attributes (start 10) need about 190 for 11;
+# powers like Hitpoints (start 25) need about 790 for 26. /questxp <nr>
+# (god) gives a quest's XP without doing it, for testing.
